Explanation:

What is a server?
A server is a machine that provides services to clients.

What is the role of the domain name?
It translates the domain name into an IP address.

What type of DNS record is www?
It is an A record.

What is the role of the web server?
Handles HTTP requests and serves content.

What is the role of the application server?
Processes logic and dynamic content.

What is the role of the database?
Stores and manages data.

How does the server communicate with the user?
Using HTTP/HTTPS over TCP/IP.

